question> Which month of 2025 had the highest average PM2.5 at delhi_centre?
SQL: SELECT
  strftime('%Y-%m', T2.date_ist) AS month,
  AVG(T2.pm2_5)
FROM hourly AS T2
INNER JOIN locations AS T1
  ON T2.location = T1.location
WHERE
  T1.location = 'delhi_centre' AND T2.date_ist LIKE '2025-%'
GROUP BY
  month
ORDER BY
  AVG(T2.pm2_5) DESC
LIMIT 1;
[ok] cols=['month', 'AVG(T2.pm2_5)']
   ('2025-12', 126.85389784946237)
Answer: ```sql
SELECT
  strftime('%Y-%m', T2.date_ist)
FROM hourly AS T2
INNER JOIN locations AS T1
  ON T2.location = T1.location
WHERE
  T1.location = 'delhi_centre' AND T2.date_ist LIKE '2025-%'
GROUP BY
  month
ORDER BY
  AVG(T2.pm2_5) DESC
LIMIT 1;
```
The month of 2025 with the highest average PM2.5 at delhi_centre was December 2025, with an average of 126.85389784946237.
