question> On how many days in 2025 did anand_vihar have a daily mean PM2.5 above 60?
SQL: SELECT
  COUNT(T1.date_ist)
FROM daily AS T1
INNER JOIN locations AS T2
  ON T1.location = T2.location
WHERE
  T1.location = 'anand_vihar' AND T1.pm2_5_mean > 60 AND T1.date_ist LIKE '2025-%';
[ok] cols=['COUNT(T1.date_ist)']
   (244,)
Answer: ```sql
SELECT
  COUNT(T1.date_ist)
FROM daily AS T1
INNER JOIN locations AS T2
  ON T1.location = T2.location
WHERE
  T1.location = 'anand_vihar' AND T1.pm2_5_mean > 60 AND T1.date_ist LIKE '2025-%';
```
There were 244 days in 2025 when the daily mean PM2.5 for anand_vihar was above 60.
